*ENVIRONMENT MODIFICATIONS
! ECO2 corrected 2026-08-06. Recomputed directly from raw chamber sensor logs
! (chamber_304_combined.csv / chamber_306_combined.csv / autopilot_combined.csv
! in the Coon raw_data_files folder), pooling ALL valid readings across ALL
! replicate grows sharing each temperature (not just the single grow the
! previous values were apparently drawn from). chamber306's CO2 sensor is
! dead for its entire history (0 valid readings ever) so grows g4/g6/g10/g11/
! g13 contribute no CO2 data; pooled means below come only from whichever
! grows had a working sensor for that temperature:
!   t1 (21.25C): g3+g5,           n=232077, mean=405.0 -> unchanged
!   t2 (24.75C): g7+g8,           n=14975,  mean=647.9 -> was 635
!   t3 (30.75C): g9 ONLY,         n=7489,   mean=679.1 -> was 545 (only 1 of
!                                           3 replicate grows has any CO2 data)
!   t4 (33.75C): g12+g14,         n=14976,  mean=699.6 -> was 494
! CAVEAT: raw chamber304 readings are noisy (individual values seen as low as
! 2-3 ppm and as high as ~1185 ppm within a single window), and Coon's own
! dissertation (Ch.3, 3.2.1) reports one pooled figure of 398+-2.18 umol/mol
! "from only 5 of the 12 growth cycles due to sensor malfunctions" without
! breaking it out by temperature -- it is not yet resolved whether that
! figure describes the treatment chambers themselves or the separate
! seedling grow tent (also stated at ~418 ppm during germination). These
! recomputed values are the best traceable-to-raw-data numbers available and
! supersede the previous per-treatment figures, which were closer to this
! dissertation figure only for t1 by chance, but are logged as uncertain.
@E ODATE  EDAY  ERAD  EMAX  EMIN ERAIN  ECO2  EDEW EWIND ENVNAME
 1 24001 - -99 - -99 - -99 - -99 A 0.0 R 405 A   0 A   0 t1_21.25C_g3+g5_pooled
 2 24043 - -99 - -99 - -99 - -99 A 0.0 R 648 A   0 A   0 t2_24.75C_g7+g8_pooled
 3 24085 - -99 - -99 - -99 - -99 A 0.0 R 679 A   0 A   0 t3_30.75C_g9only_pooled
 4 24127 - -99 - -99 - -99 - -99 A 0.0 R 700 A   0 A   0 t4_33.75C_g12+g14_pooled

